  "job_B9.2.6_20251003_115001": {
    "chunk_text": "ultum gegaderade. \u00dea pompeius \u00fe\u00e6t hierde, \u00fea for he him \u00e6fter mid ungemetlican fultume. He h\u00e6fde eahta & eahtatig coortana, \u00fe\u00e6t we nu truman hata\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m dagum V hund \u00deis eall he h\u00e6fde buton his agnum fultume & buton Caton, his geferan, & buton \u00feara senatuses. & Iulius h\u00e6fde eahtatig coortena. Heora \u00e6g\u00feer h\u00e6fde his folc on \u00ferim heapum, & hie selfe w\u00e6ron on \u00fe\u00e6m midmestan, & \u00fea o\u00fere \u00dea Iulius h\u00e6fde \u00e6nne \u00feara d\u00e6la gefliemed, \u00fea cleopode Pompeius him to ymbe Romana ealde \u00dea andwyrde he him & cw\u00e6\u00f0: On sumre tide \u00feu w\u00e6re min gefera; & for \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee \u00feu nu ne eart, \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s sio gecwedr\u00e6den \u00fee Romane geset h\u00e6fdon, \u00fe\u00e6t hiora nan o\u00f0erne on \u00feone andwlitan \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m wordum Pompeius wear\u00f0 gefliemed mid eallum his folce. & he self si\u00fe\u00fean o\u00fefleah on Asiam mid his wife & mid his bearnum. & si\u00fe\u00fean he for on \u00c6gyptum, & him fultumes b\u00e6d \u00e6t Pholomeuse \u00fe\u00e6m cyninge. & ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he to him com, he him het \u00fe\u00e6t heafod of aceorfan, & hit si\u00fe\u00fean het Iuliuse Ac \u00fea hit mon to him brohte, he w\u00e6s m\u00e6nende \u00fea d\u00e6d mid micle wope, for \u00feon he w\u00e6s eallra \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Photolomeus gel\u00e6dde fird wi\u00f0 Iuliuse, & eall his folc wear\u00f0 gef",
